Rails Launches Stellar-Based Onchain Vaults for Institutional Crypto Derivatives
Rails, an institutional crypto derivatives platform, has introduced Institutional-Grade Vaults built on the Stellar network to support high-speed perpetual futures trading with segregated 
custody and onchain verification 
