Strategic Impact
By combining onchain transparency, segregated custody, and Stellar’s settlement speed, Rails aims to make institutional derivatives trading safer, more verifiable, and more accessible to 
regulated intermediaries. This could set a new standard for custody in the crypto derivatives space.
